== Spike Slime (L) ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Spike Slime (L)}}
{{Keyword Infobox|Split}}
'''Spike Slime (L)''' is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] found exclusively in Act 1.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Spike Slime (L)}}
Has a 30% chance of using {{Int|Spike Slime (L)|Flame Tackle}} and a 70% chance of using {{Int|Spike Slime (L)|Lick}}. Cannot use the same move three times in a row.

On {{Asc|17|Ascension}}, it cannot use {{Int|Spike Slime (L)|Lick}} twice in a row.

Once its HP reaches 50% or lower, its current [[Intent]] will be interrupted and changed to {{Int|Spike Slime (L)|Split}}.

=== Found With ===
It is only found by itself in combat.

