== Acid Slime (L) ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Acid Slime (L)}}{{Keyword Infobox|Split}}
'''Acid Slime (L)''' is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] exclusively found in Act 1.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Acid Slime (L)}}
Has a 30% ({{Asc|17|40%}}) chance of using {{Int|Acid Slime (L)|Corrosive Spit}}, a 40% ({{Asc|17|30%}}) chance of using {{Int|Acid Slime (L)|Tackle}} and a 30% chance of using {{Int|Acid Slime (L)|Lick}} every turn.

Cannot use {{Int|Acid Slime (L)|Tackle}} ({{Asc|17|Lick}}) twice in a row and cannot use other moves three times in a row.

Once its HP reaches 50% or lower, its current [[Intent]] will be interrupted and changed to {{Int|Acid Slime (L)|Split}}.

=== Found With ===

===== Act 1 =====
Only found solo.

== Acid Slime (M) ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Acid Slime (M)}}
'''Acid Slime (M)''' is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] found exclusively in Act 1.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Acid Slime (M)}}
Identical pattern to {{M|Acid Slime (L)}} but it cannot {{Int|Acid Slime (L)|Split}}.

On {{Asc|17|Ascension}}: Every turn it has a 40% change of using {{Int|Acid Slime (M)|Corrosive Spit}}, a 40% chance of using {{Int|Acid Slime (M)|Tackle}}, and a 20% chance of using {{Int|Acid Slime (M)|Lick}}. {{Int|Acid Slime (M)|Lick}} cannot be used twice in a row and other moves cannot be used 3 times in a row.

=== Found With ===

===== Act 1 =====
Can be in the Easy Pool's '''Small Slimes''' encounter with a {{M|Spike Slime (S)}}.

Can be a part of the '''Exordium Thugs''' encounter along with either:
* One of the [[Slavers]]
* {{M|Cultist}}
* {{M|Looter}}
Can be found as half of the '''Exordium Wildlife''' encounter with either:

* {{M|Fungi Beast}}
* {{M|Jaw Worm}}

